msgstr "死となれ、世界を滅ぼす者となれ。"

#: script/room.js:1153
msgid "become the destroyer of worlds. use a nuke to kill the most deadly of foes. builder can channel wanderer technology to craft a handheld nuke."
msgstr "世界を滅ぼす者となれ。核を使い最も凶悪な敵を屠れ。建築家は放浪者の技術を活用し、携行式の核を作れる。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3826
msgid "bedrolls, torn and blackened, lay beneath a thin layer of dust."
msgstr "寝袋は破れて黒ずみ、薄く埃をかぶっている"

#: script/swamp.js:85
msgid "before, there was an end to each one, and a world at the end of it. after, there was only the next."
msgstr "以前は、それぞれに終わりがあり、その終わりに世界があった。以後は、ただ次があるだけだった。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:482
msgid "behind the barricade, a few weapons lay abandoned."
msgstr "バリケードの陰に、いくつかの武器が打ち捨てられている。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6148
msgid "behind the door, a deformed figure awakes and attacks."
msgstr "ドアの陰から、異形の姿が目覚めて攻撃してきた。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1681
msgid "behind the rack the wall carries a second grid, larger than the first, and lit a different colour."
msgstr "棚の裏側、壁にはもう一つの格子があり、最初のものより大きく、違う色で光っている。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2081
msgid "behind you the doors close, and go on closing, past the point where a door would stop."
msgstr "背後で扉が閉まり、閉まり続ける。扉が止まるはずの地点をも越えて。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7365
msgid "bellowing"
msgstr "咆哮"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4864
msgid "beneath the wanderer's rags, clutched in one of its many hands, a glint of steel."
msgstr "放浪者のボロ布の下で、多くの手の1つが、鋼の輝きを握りしめていた。"

#: script/engine.js:63
msgid "better avoid conflict in the wild"
msgstr "荒野での衝突をより避ける"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1979
msgid "better to move without drawing attention."
msgstr "注意を引かずに動く方がいい。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:666
msgid "beyond the bulkhead is a small antechamber, seemingly untouched by scavengers."
msgstr "隔壁の向こうには小さな控えの間があり、略奪者の手が入っていないようだ。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1282
msgid "bigfoot"
msgstr "ビッグフット"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1272
msgid "Bigfoot"
msgstr "ビッグフット"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6247
msgid "bird must have liked shiney things."
msgstr "鳥はキラキラしたものが好きなはずだ。"

#: script/outside.js:107
msgid "bits of meat"
msgstr "肉のかけら"

#: script/events/executioner.js:885
msgid "bits of them can be scavenged."
msgstr "それらの断片を漁ることができる。"

#: script/room.js:1100
msgid "black powder and bullets, like the old days."
msgstr "昔のような黒色火薬や弾丸"

#: script/events/road.js:1329
msgid "black rain, and it does not rain out here"
msgstr "黒い雨。だがここでは雨は降らない"

#: script/world.js:101
msgid "blast"
msgstr "ビーム"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7423
msgid "bleached bones are strewn about the entrance. many, deeply scored with jagged grooves."
msgstr "白い骨が入り口の辺りに散らばっている。深いギザギザの溝がたくさん刻まれている。"

#: script/outside.js:1324
msgid "blood red sky"
msgstr "血の色の空"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1219
msgid "blow it down"
msgstr "それを吹き飛ばす"

#: script/fabricator.js:249
#: script/mobileUI.js:45
msgid "blueprints"
msgstr "設計図"

#: script/engine.js:921
msgid "bluesky"
msgstr "Bluesky"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6315
msgid "bodies and supplies from both sides litter the ground."
msgstr "死体と物資が両側から地面にこぼれている。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1456
msgid "bodies litter the ground on either side."
msgstr "両側の地面に死体が散らばっている。"

#: script/localization.js:32
msgid "bolas"
msgstr "ボーラ"

#: script/room.js:776
#: script/room.js:790
msgid "bone spear"
msgstr "骨の槍"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:269
msgid "both go out at the same instant."
msgstr "両方とも同じ瞬間に消える。"

#: script/events/outside.js:862
msgid "both groups are taken in"
msgstr "両方の集団を受け入れる"

#: script/events/outside.js:894
msgid "both groups are told there is no room."
msgstr "両方の集団に、部屋はないと告げる。"

#: script/events/outside.js:898
msgid "both groups are turned away"
msgstr "両方の集団を追い返す"

#: script/events/outside.js:832
msgid "both groups walked here. neither of them has aged a day more than the walk."
msgstr "両方の集団はここまで歩いてきた。どちらも歩いた分以上には老けていない。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7207
msgid "both hands"
msgstr "両手"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:690
msgid "both walls go inert together."
msgstr "両方の壁が同時に不活性化する。"

#: script/engine.js:15
msgid "boxer"
msgstr "ボクサー"

#: script/events/path.js:42
msgid "bring in whoever is still out there"
msgstr "まだ外にいる者を連れ入れる"

#: script/engine.js:815
msgid "bring the room with you."
msgstr "この部屋を持って行け。"

#: script/engine.js:857
msgid "bring your friends."
msgstr "友達を連れてくる"

#: script/events/executioner.js:88
msgid "broken medic"
msgstr "壊れた医療兵"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4189
msgid "broken streetlights stand, rusting. light hasn't graced this place in a long time."
msgstr "壊れた街灯が錆びて立っている。ここは長い間、光に彩られていないようだ。"

#: script/mobileUI.js:36
msgid "build"
msgstr "建てる"

#: script/events/room.js:1635
msgid "build the fire up"
msgstr "火を大きくする"

#: script/engine.js:1508
#: script/room.js:2219
msgid "build:"
msgstr "建築："

#: script/localization.js:13
msgid "builder"
msgstr "建築家"

#: script/room.js:404
msgid "builder finishes the smokehouse. she looks hungry."
msgstr "建築家は燻製場を完成させた。彼女は空腹のようだ。"

#: script/room.js:1898
msgid "builder just shivers"
msgstr "建築家はただ震えている"

#: script/world.js:1201
msgid "builder knows the strange device when she sees it. takes it for herself real quick. doesn’t ask where it came from."
msgstr "建築家はその奇妙な装置を見てすぐに分かる。あっという間に自分のものにする。どこから来たのかは尋ねない。"

#: script/room.js:382
msgid "builder points to the furs from the dead beasts. she says leather could be useful. says the villagers could make it."
msgstr "建築家が死んだ獣の毛皮を指さす。革は役立つかもしれないと言う。村人たちなら作れるだろうと言う。"

#: script/room.js:132
msgid "builder puts up a hut, out in the forest. says word will get around."
msgstr "建築家は森に小屋を建てた. この噂が広まるだろうと言っている"

#: script/room.js:538
msgid "builder says an armoury can produce bullets, but she doesn't intend to touch a gun ever again"
msgstr "建築家は、武器庫があれば弾丸を作れると言うが、彼女自身は二度と銃に触れるつもりはないという。"

#: script/room.js:357
msgid "builder says leather could be useful. says the {0} could make it."
msgstr "建築家は、革は役立つかもしれないと言う。{0}なら作れるだろうと言う。"

#: script/room.js:74
msgid "builder says she can make a cart for carrying wood"
msgstr "建築家は、木材を運ぶ荷車を作れると言っている"

#: script/room.js:36
msgid "builder says she can make traps to catch any creatures might still be alive out there"
msgstr "建築家は、生き残った生き物を捕える罠を作れると言っている"

#: script/room.js:449
msgid "builder says she could make finer things, if she had the tools"
msgstr "建築家は、道具があればもっと良い物を作れると言っている"

#: script/room.js:586
msgid "builder says she has come up with a better trap design"
msgstr "建築家がより良い罠の設計を思いついたと言う"

#: script/room.js:610
msgid "builder says she has come up with a better trap design. wanderer ingenuity and steel versus the beasts of the wilds."
msgstr "建築家がより良い罠の設計を思いついたと言う。放浪者の創意工夫と鋼が、荒野の獣に立ち向かう。"

#: script/room.js:488
msgid "builder says the {0} could make steel, given the tools"
msgstr "建築家は、道具さえあれば{0}が鋼を作れると言う"

#: script/room.js:174
msgid "builder says the huts could be rebuilt in steel. says they would not burn."
msgstr "建築家は、小屋を鋼で建て直せると言う。もう燃えないだろうと言う。"

#: script/room.js:203
msgid "builder says the sulphur could be made to hold a charge, with the right furnace."
msgstr "建築家は、適切な炉があれば硫黄に電荷を蓄えさせられると言う。"

#: script/room.js:131
msgid "builder says there are more wanderers. says they'll work, too."
msgstr "建築家は、他にも放浪者がいて働いてくれるだろうと言っている"

#: script/room.js:148
msgid "builder says there are more wanderers. says they'll work, too. the fire will attract them, but they will need a place to stay."
msgstr "建築家は、まだ他にも放浪者がいると言う。彼らも働くだろうと言う。火は彼らを引き寄せるが、住む場所が必要になるだろう。"

#: script/room.js:89
msgid "builder says to work smarter not harder. head still groggy but the fire needs more wood. having a cart means more time in the warm room and less time in the cold and dangerous woods."
msgstr "建築家は、力任せではなく賢く働けと言う。頭はまだぼんやりしているが、火にはもっと木材が必要だ。荷車があれば暖かい部屋で過ごす時間が増え、冷たく危険な森で過ごす時間が減る。"

#: script/room.js:1621
msgid "builder stokes the fire"
msgstr "建築家は火を焚いている"

#: script/events/room.js:541
msgid "builder's not sure he's to be trusted."
msgstr "建築家は彼が信用できるかどうかわからない。"

#: script/events/room.js:625
msgid "builder's not sure she's to be trusted."
msgstr "建築家は彼女が信用できるかどうかわからない。"

#: script/outside.js:875
msgid "builder`s gaze"
msgstr "建築家の眼差し"

#: script/localization.js:18
msgid "bullets"
msgstr "弾薬"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1230
msgid "bulwark"
msgstr "防壁"

