#: script/events/outside.js:113
msgid "so dependent on fire for warmth and life until it takes it away."
msgstr "暖かさと命のために火にこれほど頼りながら、それがすべてを奪うまで。"

#: script/space.js:1111
msgid "so much debris of dead ships from long lost wars.<br>some wanderer ships. some others.<br>sky begins to clear into an endless expanse."
msgstr "とうに失われた戦争による死んだ船の残骸がこれほど多く。<br>放浪者の船もあれば、他のものもある。<br>空は晴れ渡り、果てしない広がりへと変わっていく。"

#: script/space.js:1065
msgid "so much debris of dead ships from long lost wars.<br>the sky opens out, and there is nobody aboard but the two of you."
msgstr "とうに失われた戦争による死んだ船の残骸がこれほど多く。<br>空が開け、船上には二人以外誰もいない。"

#: script/room.js:2091
msgid "so they have somewhere to be kept"
msgstr "彼らを収容する場所ができるように"

#: script/room.js:2082
msgid "so they have somewhere to belong"
msgstr "彼らが属する場所ができるように"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3261
msgid "so what happened to them"
msgstr "それで彼らはどうなったのか"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1012
msgid "soldier"
msgstr "兵士"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:7076
msgid "soldiers patrol the perimeter, rifles slung over their shoulders."
msgstr "兵士たちは肩にライフルを掛けて周囲をパトロールしている。"

#: script/events/outside.js:236
msgid "some {0} are ill"
msgstr "{0}の一部が病気になっている"

#: script/events/outside.js:144
msgid "some {0} have died"
msgstr "{0}の一部が死んだ"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2963
msgid "some are missing. others are closer than they ought to be."
msgstr "一部は行方不明だ。他は本来より近くにいる。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2224
msgid "some completed explosives in the corner."
msgstr "隅に完成した爆発物がいくつか。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6248
msgid "some good stuff woven into its nest."
msgstr "その巣には良い物が織り込まれている。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4936
msgid "some medicine abandoned in the drawers."
msgstr "いくつかの薬が引き出しに放置されていた。"

#: script/events/road.js:452
msgid "some of the tracks shift from two feet to crawling and then being dragged away."
msgstr "足跡の一部は二本足から這うものへと変わり、そして引きずられていったものになる。"

#: script/events/outside.js:13
msgid "some of the traps have been torn apart."
msgstr "いくつかの罠が引き裂かれた。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1591
msgid "some of them are fixed and will not move. the rest turn under a fingertip."
msgstr "それらの一部は固定されて動かない。残りは指先で動く。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1885
msgid "some of them are human. some of them are wanderers. none of them appear to consider this worth remarking on."
msgstr "その一部は人間だ。一部は放浪者だ。誰もこれを特筆すべきことだとは考えていないようだ。"

#: script/events/outside.js:208
msgid "some of them are not anywhere."
msgstr "それらの一部はどこにも存在しない。"

#: script/events/outside.js:207
msgid "some of them are still outside the wall in the morning."
msgstr "それらの一部は朝になってもまだ壁の外にいる。"

#: script/events/road.js:1533
msgid "some of them have been kneeling long enough that the ground has come up around their knees."
msgstr "彼らの一部は長く跪き続け、地面が膝の周りまで盛り上がっている。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3080
msgid "some of what it protected was worth protecting."
msgstr "それが守っていたものの一部は、守る価値があった。"

#: script/space.js:1072
msgid "some part of you wonders whether you escaped at all,<br>or whether this is only the part where you get to leave."
msgstr "あなたの一部は、本当に脱出したのか、<br>それとも単に去ることを許される部分にすぎないのかと考える。"

#: script/events/outside.js:22
msgid "some traps have been destroyed"
msgstr "いくつかの罠が破壊された"

#: script/events/room.js:1029
msgid "some weird glowing boxes he picked up on his travels."
msgstr "彼が旅の途中で拾った奇妙な光る箱。"

#: script/events/room.js:1013
msgid "some weird metal he picked up on his travels."
msgstr "彼が旅の途中で拾った奇妙な金属。"

#: script/events/room.js:262
#: script/events/room.js:282
#: script/events/room.js:302
msgid "some wood is missing."
msgstr "いくつか木材が足りない"

#: script/events/path.js:722
msgid "somebody built these huts out of a thing that came down here. a long time before anybody in this village did."
msgstr "誰かがここに落ちてきた何かからこれらの小屋を建てた。この村の誰かがそうするよりずっと前に。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3079
msgid "somebody catalogued what they saw coming and then drew up what a settlement would need to survive it. both answers. they did not choose."
msgstr "誰かが迫りくるものを目録にし、それから入植地がそれを生き延びるために必要なものを書き上げた。両方の答えを。選ばなかったのだ。"

#: script/events/road.js:918
msgid "somebody comes here. regularly. and then goes back the way they came."
msgstr "誰かが定期的にここへ来る。そして来た道を戻っていく。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3165
msgid "somebody dug here before. what is left of their kit is folded into the layer they stopped at."
msgstr "以前誰かがここを掘った。彼らの道具の残骸が、彼らが止まった層に折り重なっている。"

#: script/events/road.js:320
msgid "somebody else has had this same idea, in this same spot, a great many times."
msgstr "他の誰かがこの同じ場所で、これと同じ考えを非常に多くの回数抱いてきた。"

#: script/events/road.js:152
msgid "somebody else's snares, with a catch in them"
msgstr "他の誰かの罠、獲物がかかっている"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3553
msgid "somebody has been at the last panel with a tool. the line about the people already living on those worlds is gouged out, and it was gouged out from the inside, by somebody who was locked in here."
msgstr "誰かが工具を持って最後のパネルにいたことがある。それらの世界にすでに人が住んでいたという一節は削り取られており、それは内側から、ここに閉じ込められていた誰かによって削られたものだ。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2655
msgid "somebody has been comparing something against something older, over and over, for a very long time, and writing down how far it has moved."
msgstr "誰かが何かをより古い何かと比較し続けてきた。何度も何度も、とても長い間、それがどれだけ動いたかを書き記しながら。"

#: script/events/room.js:1693
msgid "somebody has been counting the prints"
msgstr "誰かがその足跡を数えてきた"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2995
msgid "somebody has been watching this sky, in shifts, across more successors than any one people could account for."
msgstr "誰かがこの空を、交代しながら見張り続けてきた。一人の人間が数えられる以上の後継者たちにわたって。"

#: script/events/road.js:108
msgid "somebody has come out this far sixty-one times and put something on this pile, and gone back."
msgstr "誰かがこれほど遠くまで六十一回やってきて、この積み荷に何かを置き、戻っていった。"

#: script/events/path.js:274
msgid "somebody has laid a line of stones along the edge of the path, running out towards the flats."
msgstr "誰かが道の縁に沿って石の列を並べた。平地へと続いていく。"

#: script/graveyard.js:69
msgid "somebody has scratched an addition under the carved text, much later and much worse."
msgstr "誰かが彫られた文の下に追記を刻んだ。ずっと後に、ずっと雑に。"

#: script/events/road.js:322
msgid "somebody has waited out this stretch before"
msgstr "以前にも誰かがこの区間を耐え抜いてきた"

#: script/village.js:77
msgid "somebody is at the door, out of breath, and does not knock first."
msgstr "誰かが扉のところにいる。息を切らし、先にノックすることもない。"

#: script/events/road.js:595
msgid "somebody is sitting down out on the flats"
msgstr "誰かが平地に座り込んでいる"

#: script/events/path.js:212
msgid "somebody presses a thumb into a handful of it and the print is still there in the morning, perfect."
msgstr "誰かがひとつかみのそれに親指を押し当て、朝になってもその跡は完璧に残っている。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3621
msgid "somebody says her name and she does not look up, and the name goes past you before you can hold on to it."
msgstr "誰かが彼女の名前を呼ぶが、彼女は顔を上げず、その名前はあなたが捉える前に通り過ぎていく。"

#: script/events/road.js:1209
msgid "somebody sealed this from the other side."
msgstr "誰かがこれを反対側から封じた。"

#: script/events/room.js:1220
msgid "somebody translated it underneath, a long time after."
msgstr "誰かがそれをその下に翻訳した。ずっと後になって。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3571
msgid "somebody was held here through a trial"
msgstr "誰かが裁判の間ここに拘束されていた"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3566
msgid "somebody was held here through a trial. the marks on the floor are a man walking the same four paces for a long time."
msgstr "誰かが裁判の間ここに拘束されていた。床の跡は、一人の男が長い間同じ四歩を歩き続けたものだ。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3281
msgid "somebody was let out, a long way from here, and this is one of the places that cost."
msgstr "誰かがここから遠く離れた場所で解放され、これはその代償を払った場所の一つだ。"

#: script/events/road.js:564
msgid "somebody with your hand has signed this stone five times. you are signing it for the first time."
msgstr "あなたの筆跡を持つ誰かが、この石に五回署名している。あなたは今回初めて署名する。"

#: script/prison.js:222
msgid "someone drew a symbol in this cell. it looks like your charms."
msgstr "誰かがこの独房に紋様を描いた。あなたのお守りに似ている。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6660
msgid "someone had been stockpiling loot here."
msgstr "誰かがここに戦利品を備蓄していた。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5600
msgid "someone has locked and barricaded the door to this operating theatre."
msgstr "誰かがこの手術室への扉に鍵をかけて封鎖した。"

#: script/events/room.js:1298
msgid "someone in the village has got an old receiver working."
msgstr "村の誰かが古い受信機を動かすことに成功した。"

#: script/events/room.js:187
msgid "someone left this. someone with less than this to spare."
msgstr "誰かがこれを残していった。これ以下しか余裕のなかった誰かが。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:5512
msgid "someone throws a stone."
msgstr "誰かが石を投げた。"

#: script/events/room.js:1406
msgid "something answered"
msgstr "何かが応えた"

#: script/events/road.js:728
msgid "something came down here hard enough to leave a furrow half a mile long."
msgstr "何かが半マイルの長さの溝を残すほどの勢いでここに落ちてきた。"

#: script/village.js:149
msgid "something catches fire, and by the time it is noticed there is nothing left to save."
msgstr "何かが火を吹き、気づいた頃には救えるものは何も残っていない。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2531
msgid "something crosses the corridor ahead, and it is made of light"
msgstr "前方の廊下を何かが横切る。それは光でできている"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:632
msgid "something detaches from the ceiling of the column room."
msgstr "柱の間の天井から何かが外れる。"

#: script/events/road.js:1122
msgid "something gives, high up, and the shaft goes past very fast."
msgstr "高い場所で何かが崩れ、縦坑が猛烈な速さで過ぎていく。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:193
msgid "something has gone up and down this a very great many times."
msgstr "何かが非常に多くの回数、これを上り下りしてきた。"

#: script/events/road.js:1377
msgid "something has settled out of the rain"
msgstr "雨から何かが沈殿した"

#: script/lab.js:361
msgid "something in the back of your mind says to turn back now."
msgstr "あなたの心の奥底で何かが、今すぐ引き返せと告げている。"

#: script/events/room.js:1631
msgid "something is circling the room"
msgstr "何かが部屋を巡っている"

#: script/events/road.js:1283
msgid "something is exposed where the sand was stripped"
msgstr "砂が剥ぎ取られた場所に何かが露出している"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2190
msgid "something is moving out on the glass"
msgstr "ガラスの上で何かが動いている"

#: script/events/room.js:1627
msgid "something is walking the perimeter of the room, slowly, and it has been for a while."
msgstr "何かが部屋の周囲をゆっくりと歩き続けている。しばらくそうしているようだ。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2263
msgid "something moving up ahead."
msgstr "前方で何かが動いている。"

#: script/events/room.js:1619
msgid "Something Outside"
msgstr "外にいる何か"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:353
msgid "something small and very fast comes along the ceiling."
msgstr "小さく非常に速い何かが天井を伝ってくる。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:44
msgid "something small breaks cover, quills flared."
msgstr "小さな何かが隠れ場所から飛び出す。棘を逆立てて。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3649
msgid "something that was standing very still stops standing very still"
msgstr "完全に静止していた何かが、静止することをやめる"

#: script/village.js:187
msgid "something the {0} call a feral terror is in among the huts before anyone sees it arrive."
msgstr "{0}が野性の恐怖と呼ぶ何かが、誰にも到着を見られることなく小屋の間に潜んでいる。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1228
msgid "something the size of the corridor comes down the corridor."
msgstr "廊下の幅いっぱいの何かが廊下を進んでくる。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3032
msgid "something unfolds from the mounting and levels itself at you"
msgstr "何かが台座から展開し、あなたに照準を合わせる"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:770
msgid "something very old finishes powering up."
msgstr "非常に古い何かが起動を終える。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1748
msgid "something wearing a wanderer"
msgstr "放浪者をまとった何か"

#: script/events/encounters.js:1738
msgid "Something Wearing a Wanderer"
msgstr "放浪者をまとった何か"

#: script/space.js:973
msgid "something with three eyes and no mouth is watching, and for once it does not look away."
msgstr "三つの目と口のない何かが見つめている。そして今回だけは、目をそらさない。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:510
msgid "something with too many edges is already running at you."
msgstr "角が多すぎる何かが、すでにあなたに向かって走ってきている。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:4651
msgid "something's causing a commotion a ways down the road."
msgstr "道の先で何かが騒ぎを起こしている。"

#: script/events/room.js:226
msgid "something's in the store room"
msgstr "何かが貯蔵庫にいる"

#: script/events/room.js:224
msgid "something's in there."
msgstr "何かがそこにいる。"

#: script/events/executioner.js:2011
msgid "something's wrong with this robot."
msgstr "このロボットは何かおかしい。"

#: script/fabricator.js:48
#: script/path.js:195
msgid "sometimes it is best not to fight."
msgstr "時には戦わないことが最善だ。"

#: script/fabricator.js:67
#: script/path.js:183
msgid "sometimes it is best to fight without restraint."
msgstr "時には手加減なく戦うことが最善だ。"

#: script/ship.js:126
msgid "somewhere above the debris cloud, the wanderer fleet hovers. been on this rock too long."
msgstr "瓦礫の雲の上のどこかに、放浪者艦隊は浮かんでいる。この岩の上に長らくあった。"

#: script/lab.js:326
msgid "somewhere behind the wall, a pump cycles, stops, and cycles again."
msgstr "壁の向こうのどこかで、ポンプが動き、止まり、また動く。"

#: script/space.js:1040
msgid "somewhere behind you the rock keeps turning. there is a room on it with a fire in it.<br>you do not look back at it."
msgstr "あなたの背後のどこかで、あの岩は回り続けている。その中には火の灯る部屋がある。<br>あなたは振り返らない。"

#: script/engine.js:1634
