msgstr "音声が利用可能です！"

#: script/engine.js:1436
msgid "sound off."
msgstr "音声オフ。"

#: script/engine.js:1432
#: script/engine.js:189
msgid "sound on."
msgstr "音声オン。"

#: script/space.js:318
msgid "Space"
msgstr "宇宙空間"

#: script/events/global.js:25
msgid "spare him"
msgstr "見逃してやる"

#: script/events/executioner.js:939
msgid "sparks cascade from a reactivated power junction, and catch."
msgstr "再起動した配電接続部から火花が滝のように飛び散り、燃え上がる。"

#: script/lab.js:338
msgid "specimen racks, emptied and washed. the labels were peeled off."
msgstr "検体棚、空にされ洗浄されている。ラベルは剥がされている。"

#: script/events/encounters.js:402
msgid "spore-choked stag"
msgstr "胞子に覆われた牡鹿"

#: script/events/encounters.js:412
msgid "spores burst"
msgstr "胞子が弾ける"

#: script/prison.js:213
msgid "square in section, exactly, and it stays exactly square."
msgstr "断面は正確に正方形で、常に正確に正方形のままだ。"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3814
msgid "squeeze"
msgstr "無理やり進む"

#: script/world.js:64
msgid "stab"
msgstr "突き刺す"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2517
msgid "stairs down to sublevel three"
msgstr "第三階層への下り階段"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2508
msgid "stairs down to sublevel two"
msgstr "第二階層への下り階段"

#: script/events/room.js:1705
msgid "stand in the doorway where they can see you"
msgstr "彼らに見える戸口に立つ"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1869
msgid "stand there"
msgstr "そこに立つ"

#: script/outside.js:1392
msgid "stars in the sky"
msgstr "空の星々"

#: script/events/outside.js:159
msgid "start clearing the ash"
msgstr "灰の除去を始める"

#: script/world.js:548
msgid "starvation sets in"
msgstr "飢えはじめた"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:1961
#: script/events/setpieces.js:1979
#: script/events/setpieces.js:2002
#: script/events/setpieces.js:2025
#: script/events/setpieces.js:2044
#: script/events/setpieces.js:2062
msgid "stay a while"
msgstr "しばらく留まる"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2512
#: script/events/setpieces.js:2521
msgid "stay on this level"
msgstr "この階層に留まる"

#: script/engine.js:62
msgid "stealthy"
msgstr "隠密術"

#: script/engine.js:822
msgid "steam"
msgstr "蒸気"

#: script/localization.js:22
#: script/path.js:146
msgid "steel"
msgstr "鋼鉄"

#: script/room.js:1003
msgid "steel armour"
msgstr "鋼の鎧"

#: script/room.js:514
msgid "steel blades and armor are a defense against the ravages and savages of the wastes. more than that. wanderers once crossed the stars. making steel seems like a step towards the future."
msgstr "鋼の刃と鎧は、荒野の猛威と野蛮さに対する防御となる。それ以上に、放浪者はかつて星々を越えた。鋼を作ることは、未来への一歩のように思える。"

#: script/room.js:171
msgid "steel hut"
msgstr "鋼の小屋"

#: script/room.js:1061
#: script/room.js:1076
msgid "steel sword"
msgstr "鋼鉄の剣"

#: script/room.js:992
msgid "steel's stronger than iron"
msgstr "鋼鉄は鉄よりも強い"

#: script/localization.js:42
#: script/outside.js:79
msgid "steelworker"
msgstr "製鋼職人"

#: script/room.js:485
#: script/room.js:511
msgid "steelworks"
msgstr "製鋼所"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:2980
#: script/events/setpieces.js:3000
msgid "step back"
msgstr "後ずさる"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:3151
msgid "step back from the face"
msgstr "岩壁から後ずさる"

#: script/events/executioner.js:1051
msgid "step inside, and the machine whirs. muscle and bone reknit. good as new."
msgstr "中に足を踏み入れると、機械が唸る。筋肉と骨が再び編み合わさる。新品同様に。"

#: script/world.js:747
msgid "stepping off the safe roads into the dark forest where anything can be lurking amongst the trees."
msgstr "安全な道を離れ、木々の間に何が潜んでいてもおかしくない暗い森へと踏み出す。"

